{
  "name": "sleep",
  "normalizations": [
    "Compare a bed's state and the sleeper's position as the client sees them while sleeping, after the night is skipped and when trying to sleep by day.",
    "Use matching flat terrain and ignore clocks, sound seeds and generated IDs.",
    "Covers using a bed at night, the 100-tick sleep, the skip to morning, standing up beside the bed and the daytime refusal."
